      "html": "<section class=\"wrap\" data-el=\"status.mandatory-note\" data-el-build=\"elementor\" style=\"padding-top:56px\"><p class=\"note\" role=\"note\">Program details coming soon. Schedules, coaching assignments, prices and capacity are not confirmed and are not published on this page.</p></section>"
