   "elements": [
    {
     "id": "f49a7d43",
     "elType": "widget",
     "widgetType": "html",
     "settings": {
      "html": "<section class=\"band--cream\" data-el=\"page.blocks\" data-el-build=\"elementor\">\n  <div class=\"wrap section\">\n    <h2 class=\"h2 mb-l reveal\" style=\"max-width:26ch\">What each program record holds.</h2>\n    <div class=\"hairline\" style=\"--min:260px\" data-stagger>\n      <div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">01</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Structured records</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Approved title, status, age group, ability level, format, schedule, location, capacity, prerequisites, accessibility, coach or provider, price, media and registration route.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">02</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Status labels</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Every program carries a visible status. Until it is approved the record shows “Program details coming soon” and collects interest only.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">03</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Adaptive pathway</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Adaptive and sensory-friendly sport is a named category in its own right, not an accommodation applied to another program.</p></div><div class=\"cell\" style=\"min-height:240px;padding:34px 28px 38px\"><span class=\"num\">04</span><h3 class=\"h3\">Registration later</h3><p style=\"font-size:15.5px\">Registration and payment stay switched off until inventory, schedules, pricing, waivers and refund terms are approved.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
     },
     "elements": []
    }
   ]
  },
